{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"852668","name":"Art Suites Korai","description":"A stay at Art Suites Korai places you in the heart of Athens, within a 10-minute walk of Omonia Square and National Archaeological Museum of Athens. This 4-star hotel is 1 mi (1.6 km) from Syntagma Square and 1.8 mi (2.9 km) from Acropolis Museum. This smoke-free hotel offers complimentary parking nearby. Grab a bite from the snack bar/deli serving guests of Art Suites Korai. Continental breakfasts are available daily from 7:00 AM to 10:00 AM for a fee. Make yourself at home in one of the 25 air-conditioned rooms featuring flat-screen televisions. Complimentary wireless Internet access keeps you connected, and cable programming is available for your entertainment. Private bathrooms with bathtubs or showers feature complimentary toiletries and hair dryers. Conveniences include desks, housekeeping is provided daily, and cribs/infant beds (complimentary) can be requested.","address":"Marnis, 27","city":"ATHENS","countryCode":"GR","postalCode":"10432","lat":37.987451,"lng":23.72786,"stars":4,"phone":"+302105240501","email":"INFO@ARTHOTELATHENS.GR","website":"www.artsuiteskorai.gr","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/85/852668/852668a_hb_a_001.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/85/852668/852668a_hb_a_002.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/85/852668/852668a_hb_a_003.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/85/852668/852668a_hb_a_004.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/85/852668/852668a_hb_a_005.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/85/852668/852668a_hb_l_002.jpg","category":"lobby","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/85/852668/852668a_hb_l_001.jpg","category":"lobby","order":6},{"url